---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import homePaperUrl from '../styles/home-paper.css?url';
import cafe from '../assets/cafe-window.html?raw';
---
<Layout title="Minh-Ha Nguyen" description="Minh-Ha Nguyen: a pharmacist turned epidemiologist at Vanderbilt, designing observational studies of medicines in large-scale health data.">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/paper/paper.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href={homePaperUrl} />
  <script is:inline>document.documentElement.classList.add('js');if(location.search.includes('static'))document.documentElement.classList.add('static');</script>
  <div class="sheet" id="sheet">
    <div class="holes" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="mline" aria-hidden="true"><i class="ink" id="ink"></i></div>
    <i class="nib" id="nib" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    <div class="stationery" aria-hidden="true"><span>No.<b>1</b></span><span>Date<b>Nov 2026</b></span></div>

    <section class="row node hero">
      <div class="margin"><small>written in</small>Nashville</div>
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Pharmacist · Epidemiologist</p>
        <h1 class="h1">Minh<span class="hy">-</span>Ha Nguyen</h1>
        <p class="lead">Bedside to <span class="circ"><em>discovery.</em><svg viewBox="0 0 220 60" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path pathLength="1" d="M30 9 C80 0 178 2 206 18 C228 32 196 54 120 56 C52 58 8 50 9 34 C10 20 46 9 98 7"/></svg></span></p>
        <p class="sub">Of the <a href="/medication-origin/">115 drug classes</a> behind the most-prescribed medicines in the US and England, 60% came from observations in populations and clinics.</p>
        <p class="cue"><b aria-hidden="true">↓</b>scroll to read on</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="cafe" aria-label="ASCII drawing: the view from a café window in Vietnam, an old shophouse with a tree growing from its roof, a Honda Cub parked at its corner, tangled wires, and an iced coffee on the sill"><pre aria-hidden="true" set:html={cafe}></pre><figcaption>A café window in Vietnam.</figcaption></figure>
    </section>

    <section class="row node entry reveal" id="work">
      <div class="margin">Selected<small>work</small></div>
      <div>
        <p>I design and analyze studies, from large-scale health data to clinical trials, to test what we observe in the clinic, and build the tools to scale the procedure.</p>
        <ul class="now snap">
          <li>Reconciled conflicting findings on finasteride and depression by re-examining each study’s comparator group.</li>
          <li>Investigated the metabolic safety of finasteride and dutasteride in population studies across South Korea and New Zealand.</li>
          <li>Analyzed a phase 2 randomized trial of G-CSF after Kasai surgery for infants with biliary atresia in Vietnam.</li>
          <li>Built agentic systems to scale scientific discovery with specialized biomedical tools and harness engineering.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <aside class="side">
        <a href="https://doi.org/10.1080/00325481.2026.2633464">Does finasteride cause depression?</a><span>Meta-analysis · Postgraduate Medicine ↗</span>
        <a href="https://doi.org/10.3349/ymj.2025.0056">Finasteride and type 2 diabetes in Korea</a><span>Nationwide cohort · Yonsei Medical Journal ↗</span>
        <a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.heliyon.2025.e41768">Finasteride and blood sugar in New Zealand</a><span>Cohort study · Heliyon ↗</span>
        <a href="https://liteodyssey.org">liteOdyssey</a><span>Agentic rare-disease diagnosis ↗</span>
        <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.16831">PIHF-MCP</a><span>How the agent learns · preprint ↗</span>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <div class="row"><h2 class="h2 span-2 reveal">Along the way</h2></div>

    <section class="row node entry tight reveal">
      <div class="margin">2024<small>to now</small></div>
      <div>
        <ul class="now">
          <li>Getting my PhD in Epidemiology at Vanderbilt, expected 2027.</li>
          <li>Investigating the association between low-dose radiation exposure and Parkinson’s disease, to support NASA’s mission to Mars.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="snap"><div class="card" style="--rot:-.6deg"><pre aria-hidden="true">[ evidence ] ---> [ agent ] ---> [ answer ]
                                     |
                              <b>trust it?</b>  y / n</pre></div></div>
      </div>
      <aside class="side">
        <a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/s41746-026-03109-z">LLM accuracy in rare diseases</a><span>Meta-analysis · npj Digital Medicine ↗</span>
        <a href="/research/">Below the Surface</a><span>My dissertation</span>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="row node entry reveal">
      <div class="margin">2020<small>to 2024</small></div>
      <div>
        <ul class="now">
          <li>Researched machine learning for predicting antimicrobial resistance, and won a first prize for it at the Asian Association of Schools of Pharmacy conference.</li>
          <li>Ran a small consultancy for hair-loss patients whose treatment at tertiary hospitals had not worked. These were the hard cases, and we still got some good results.</li>
          <li>Taught clinical pharmacy and researched medical education at the University of Medicine and Pharmacy at Ho Chi Minh City, among other things.</li>
          <li>Conducted medical research at Yonsei University College of Medicine.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="snap"><div class="card" style="--rot:-1.1deg"><pre aria-hidden="true">+---------------------------+
|  Rx    guideline  says  <b>A</b> |
|        patient    shows <b>B</b> |
+---------------------------+</pre></div></div>
      </div>
      <aside class="side">
        <a href="/hairloss/">Hair-loss evidence + access</a><span>In English and Vietnamese</span>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="row node entry reveal">
      <div class="margin">2014<small>to 2019</small></div>
      <div>
        <ul class="now">
          <li>I left Vietnam for the UK at 17 to study pharmacy at Queen’s University Belfast, then the top-ranked pharmacy school in the UK.</li>
          <li>My master’s thesis built computational models of in vitro drug effects in cystic fibrosis. It turned out to be a dead end, but I’m glad the field found another way: new drugs now treat most people with the disease.</li>
          <li>I became a licensed clinical pharmacist with the General Pharmaceutical Council (GPhC).</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="snap"><div class="card" style="--rot:.7deg"><pre aria-hidden="true">+---------------------------+
|  VN  - - - - - - - ->  UK |
|  age <b>17</b>                   |
+---------------------------+</pre></div></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="row node entry reveal" id="funders">
      <div class="margin">Funders<small>with thanks</small></div>
      <div>
        <ul class="ledger">
          <li><b>KOICA</b><span>MEF Fellowship, 2023</span></li>
          <li><b>NASA</b><span>Doctoral research on low-dose radiation and Parkinson’s disease</span></li>
          <li><b>Anthropic</b><span>AI for Science program, for our rare-disease diagnosis research</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="row node entry reveal" id="invite">
      <div class="margin">Open<small>questions</small></div>
      <div><p class="pull">Bring me <span class="ul"><em>two answers that disagree.</em><svg viewBox="0 0 200 10" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path pathLength="1" d="M2 7 C40 3 110 9 198 4"/></svg></span></p>
        <div class="snap"><div class="cases">
          <div class="card case"><b>case 01</b>one drug, two databases, two answers</div>
          <div class="card case"><b>case 02</b>top of the benchmark, lost on real patients</div>
          <div class="card case"><b>case 03</b>the guideline says one thing, the patient another</div>
        </div></div>
        <p class="muted snap">If studies conflict on a medical question you care about, write to me. I am looking for collaborators to work through these questions together.</p>
        <span class="stamp">Open to collaborators</span></div>
      <aside class="side"><a href="mailto:ha.m.nguyen@vanderbilt.edu">ha.m.nguyen@vanderbilt.edu</a><span>Write to me ↗</span></aside>
    </section>

    <section class="row node entry reveal">
      <div class="margin">Belief</div>
      <div><p class="pull">Health is rarely lost all at once. It goes in <em>small chips that compound.</em></p><p class="muted">Common conditions deserve more care than they get. That is the longer road I am on.</p></div>
    </section>
  </div>
  <script is:inline src="/paper/paper.js" defer></script>
</Layout>
